{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-dijiayureqiandao",
  "id": "source-29002",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29002001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "一日不见，如隔三秋，三日不见，如隔九秋！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29002002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "迪迦特别座谈会，今日继续。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29002003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "关于上次大古在TV剧集中一共坠机多少次的问题，主人有答案了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29002004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "经过我谨慎的推理，细致的研究，加上重新看完一遍迪迦剧集后，我算出来的次数一共是——20次！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29002005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "bingo，恭喜主人，答对了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29002006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29002007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "迪迦也感到惊讶呢，没想到自己经历过这么多次坠机事故。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29002008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "那么第二个问题是，迪迦在TV中一共断过多少只怪物的角？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29002009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "一定都要是这么奇怪的问题吗！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29002010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "因为只有回答出这样的问题，才能彰显主人对迪迦深沉的爱，才能体现主人的智慧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29002011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……我懂了，下期见。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29002012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "下期见！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
